- Build a small calibrated token extractor that distinguishes (i) frozen class ids, (ii) registered variant ids of form `<parent_class>-<VARIANT>` (5 groups), (iii) strings inside file paths (which should be resolved to the variant base name), and (iv) genuinely unknown class tokens.
