- Provide fixtures with expected verdicts including mutants (a genuinely unknown class token, a class token used in a class_id field, a variant token claimed as a class id) to show the checker catches real leaks and doesn't flag legitimate variant references.
- Emit artifact + review events with IDs, evidence, sha256, falsifier.
- Checkpoint.

